The 'event-types' folder contains TypeScript definitions for various event structures that flow through the application, organizing data contracts for game client-server communications, GMCP protocols, and shattered archive systems. These type definitions ensure consistent data handling across different components of the project, from remote server events to user script interactions. The folder serves as a centralized location for all event data schemas, enabling type-safe communication between the game client, remote servers, and the shattered archive system.
